    <string name="bubble_help_message">Paragraph comment bubbles turn dp images in rules into native SVG bubbles.\n\nFormat:\n&lt;img src=&quot;dp:12,{&quot;pclick&quot;:&quot;...&quot;,&quot;status&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;}&quot;&gt;\n\nThe number after dp: replaces ${num} in the SVG template.\nstatus is optional: normal uses the regular color, emphasis uses the accent color. It defaults to normal.\nThe SVG template supports the ${color} and ${num} placeholders.\nBuilt-in bubbles are read-only. Add or import one to create a custom bubble.</string>
